        },
        "CAUSES & RISK FACTORS": {
          "present": true,
          "status": "content",
          "source_heading": "CAUSES & RISK FACTORS",
          "canonical_heading": "CAUSES & RISK FACTORS",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Majority of cats reported had type I disc degeneration, with extrusion of mineralized nucleus pulposus into vertebral canal resulting in spinal cord trauma and compression.",
              "pdf_page": 862,
              "printed_page": 780,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Unlike dogs, where chondrodystrophic breeds (e.g., dachshunds) predisposed to type I disc disease and subsequent extrusion, no",
              "pdf_page": 862,
              "printed_page": 780,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "obvious risk factors apparent in cats.",
              "pdf_page": 862,
              "printed_page": 780,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Most cats reported had clinically significant disc protrusions or extrusions between T11 and S1; similar to dogs, presence of the intercapital ligament from T1 to T10 may make disc protrusions in that region less likely.",
              "pdf_page": 862,
              "printed_page": 780,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "of adjacent mineralized discs should be",
              "pdf_page": 862,
              "printed_page": 780,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "considered to avoid recurrence.",
              "pdf_page": 862,
              "printed_page": 780,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Medical management (cage rest, pain management)",
              "pdf_page": 862,
              "printed_page": 780,
              "column": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
