              "text": "Strict cage rest for on all imaging sequences; extradural medically managed and postoperative patients compression may be apparent; with ANNPE, for 4–6 weeks, then gradual increase in decreased T2 intensity of nucleus pulposus of activity and physical therapy, as needed. likely extruded disc, hyperintensity in",
